<lb n="28"/>blibe, darzuo ir uch wollend genaigt sin erbotten. Soust
<lb n="29"/>muesten ir der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittlen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgedenckhen</unclear>.
